+ * preserve that group component instead of collapsing both groups onto the
+ * low MIDI nibble.  Group zero is retained as the legacy fallback used by
+ * callers that do not fill dwChannelGroup. */
+/* Spreading channel groups over separate FluidSynth channels is correct
